/* icons-gen.js — the drawn icon set, embedded.

   Sixteen system emoji on one screen is what a placeholder looks like, and
   emoji render differently on every device so the app cannot be art-directed
   at all. These are drawn to Bizzing Bee's icon spec — chunky multi-colour
   sticker illustrations with a soft ink outline and a gloss, legible down to
   20px — in Finance's own palette.

   Generated with a generative IMAGE model, cropped and squared here. No
   generated lettering: every prompt banned text, letters, numbers and
   signage, because type is the app's own faces and nothing else.

   26 icons, 61 kB total. Regenerate with tools/art. */

